      "marks_pos": 1.0,
      "marks_neg": 0.25,
      "question": "Select the correct combination of mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs and to balance the given equation.\n\n11 * 12 * 70 * 175 * 5 * 97",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "×, + , – , ÷ , ="
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "×, – , + , ÷ , ="
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "+ , ×, –, ÷ , ="
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "×, – , + , = , ÷"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 11 * 12 * 70 * 175 * 5 * 97\n\nOption 1) ×, + , – , ÷ , =\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ 11 × 12 + 70 - __**175 ÷ 5**__ = 97\n\n⇒ __**11 × 12**__ + 70 - 35 = 97\n\n⇒ __**132 + 70**__ - 35 = 97\n\n⇒ __**202 - 35**__ = 97\n\n⇒ 167 = 97\n\n**Option 2) ×, – , + , ÷ , =**\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ 11 × 12 - 70 + **__175 ÷ 5__ **= 97\n\n⇒ **__132__** - 70 + __**35**__ = 97\n\n⇒ __**167 - 70**__ = 97\n\n**⇒ 97 = 97**\n\nOption 3) + , ×, –, ÷ , =\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ 11 + 12 × 70 - __**175 ÷ 5**__ = 97\n\n⇒ 11 + __**12 × 70**__ - 35 = 97\n\n⇒ __**11 + 840**__ - 35 = 97\n\n⇒ **__851 - 35__** = 97\n\n⇒ 816 = 97\n\nOption 4) ×, – , + , = , ÷\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**11 × 12**__ - 70 + 175 = __**5 ÷ 97**__\n\n⇒ __**132**__ - 70 __**+ 175 **__ = 0.05\n\n⇒ __**307 - 70**__ = 0.05\n\n⇒ 237 = 0.05\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"×, – , + , ÷ , =\".**",
      "solution_images": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png",
          "alt": ""
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "Logical Puzzle"
      ]
    },
