      "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: (1st number)² × 3) + 7 = 2nd number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 8 : 199\n\n⇒ (8² × 3) + 7 = (64 × 3) + 7 = 192 + 7 = 199.\n\nFor, 5 : 82\n\n⇒ (5² × 3) + 7 = (25 × 3) + 7 = 75 + 7 = 82.\n\nSimilarly, for 12 ∶ 439\n\n**⇒ (12² × 3) + 7 = (144 × 3) + 7 = 432 + 7 = 439.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
